<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#contactPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Informazioni di contatto rilevanti per la risorsa catalogata. Si raccomanda l'uso di vCard."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#contactPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relevant contact information for the catalogued resource. Use of vCard is recommended."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#contactPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relevante kontaktoplysninger for den katalogiserede ressource. Anvendelse af vCard anbefales."@da .
