<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#endpointURL> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "přístupový bod služby"@cs .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#endpointURL> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "service end-point"@en .
