# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Catalog> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Resource> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A resource that is listed in the catalog."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una risorsa elencata nel catalogo."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-3/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "resource"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "risorsa"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "New property added in DCAT 3."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Nová vlastnost přidaná ve verzi DCAT 3."@cs .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Nueva propiedad agregada en DCAT 3."@es .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Nuova proprietà aggiunta in DCAT 3."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A resource that is listed in the catalog."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Una risorsa elencata nel catalogo."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Status: English Definition text modified by DCAT 3 revision team, translations pending."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Questo è il predicate più generale per indicare l'appartenenza di una risorsa a un catalogo. Si raccomanda l'uso di una proprietà più specifica, quando disponibile."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "See also:\tSub-properties of dcat:resource in particular dcat:dataset, dcat:catalog, dcat:service."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This is the most general predicate for membership of a catalog. Use of a more specific sub-property is recommended when available."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Vd. anche: Le sottoproprietà di dcat:resource, in particolare: dcat:dataset, dcat:catalog, dcat:service."@it .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#seriesMember
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#seriesMember> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#inSeries> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#seriesMember> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-3/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#seriesMember> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "New property added in DCAT 3."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#seriesMember> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Nová vlastnost přidaná ve verzi DCAT 3."@cs .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#seriesMember> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Nueva propiedad agregada en DCAT 3."@es .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#seriesMember> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Nuova proprietà aggiunta in DCAT 3."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#seriesMember> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Esta propiedad inversa PUEDE usarse sólo en combinación con su inversa, y NO PUEDE utilizarse en su reemplazo."@es .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#seriesMember> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Questa proprietà PUÒ essere usata solo insieme alla sua inversa, e NON DEVE essere usata per sostituirla."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#seriesMember> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This property MAY be used only in addition to its inverse, and it MUST NOT be used to replace it."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#DataService> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A collection of data that this DataService can distribute."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "En samling af data som denne datatjeneste kan distribuere."@da .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Kolekce dat, kterou je tato Datová služba schopna poskytnout."@cs .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una colección de datos que este Servicio de Datos puede distribuir."@es .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una raccolta di dati che questo DataService può distribuire."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "datatjeneste for datasæt"@da .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "poskytuje datovou sadu"@cs .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "provee conjunto de datos"@es .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "serve set di dati"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "serves dataset"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "distribuerer"@da .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "ekspederer"@da .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "udstiller"@da .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "New property in DCAT 2."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Nová vlastnost přidaná ve verzi DCAT 2."@cs .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Nueva propiedad agregada en DCAT 2."@es .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Nuova proprietà in DCAT 2."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A collection of data that this DataService can distribute."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "En samling af data som denne datatjeneste kan distribuere."@da .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Kolekce dat, kterou je tato Datová služba schopna poskytnout."@cs .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Una colección de datos que este Servicio de Datos puede distribuir."@es .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#servesDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Una raccolta di dati che questo DataService può distribuire."@it .
