<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#actedOnBehalfOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#inverse> "hadDelegate" .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#actedOnBehalfOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedForm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Delegation> .
