<https://w3id.org/rdip/generatesResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a ResearchActivity to an EvaluationResult it produces (e.g. a test-set accuracy, F1 score, RMSE, training loss). Essential for verifying reproduction: a reproducer compares their re-run results against these stored values."@en .
<https://w3id.org/rdip/generatesResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "generates result"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/rdip/generatesSoftware
