<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/scientific-research#irbNumber> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Every clinical trial in the United States must be approved and monitored by an Institutional Review Board (IRB). An IRB is an independent committee of physicians, statisticians, community advocates and others whose objective is to ensure that a clinical trial is ethical and the rights of study participants are protected. " .
