<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000013> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "person:Chris Stoeckert"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000013> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "OBI_0000159"@en .
