<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Chris Stoeckert"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Jonathan Rees"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "data"@en .
