<http://purl.org/net/OCRe/study_design.owl#Single_group_study> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A single group study is an interventional study that has only a single allocation group and no contemporaneuos comparison group.\nA study in which an individual acts has his/her own comparison does not fall into this category, since an individual is not a group." .
