<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#Museum> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Definition was take from here:  http://dictionary.reference.com/browse/museum" .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#Museum> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "The Getty Museum" .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#Museum> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An organization devoted to the acquisition, conservation, study, exhibition, and educational interpretation of objects having scientific, historical, cultural or artistic value." .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#Museum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Museum"@en .
