<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#OutreachProviderRole> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "The example is one outreach role required by US space agency NASA, which is related with one project in NASA. Name of the outreach role should be put here." .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#OutreachProviderRole> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An outreach or community service role directed outside a person's primary profession and institution" .
