# 
# http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrimaryPosition
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrimaryPosition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrimaryPosition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#Position> .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrimaryPosition> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "A position designated as primary by the organization or group where it is held. This designation may be applied to zero or more of an agent's positions and may be asserted in conjunction with other subclasses of position." .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrimaryPosition> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A position designated as primary by the organization where it is held." .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrimaryPosition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Primary Position"@en .
# 
# http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrincipalInvestigatorRole
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrincipalInvestigatorRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrincipalInvestigatorRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#InvestigatorRole> .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrincipalInvestigatorRole> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Role of a person to direct a project or activity being supported by an Agreement (for example, a grant), and who is accountable to the grantee for the proper conduct of the project or activity. Also known as Program Director or Project Director." .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrincipalInvestigatorRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Principal Investigator Role"@en .
# 
# http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrivateCompany
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrivateCompany> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrivateCompany> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#Company> .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrivateCompany> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Definition obtained here: http://answers.ask.com/Business/Finance/what_is_a_private_company.  Examples of private companies found here: http://www.forbes.com/2008/11/03/largest-private-companies-biz-privates08-cx_sr_1103private_land.html" .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrivateCompany> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Publix Super Markets; Ernst & Young; PricewaterhouseCoopers" .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrivateCompany> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A private company is one that is privately-owned, and thus, is not publicly-traded in the stock market. Members of the general public cannot purchase stock in a private company unless that company chooses to go public and become a public company." .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#PrivateCompany> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Private Company"@en .
# 
