<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#ResearcherRole> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Examples of research can be seen at: http://www.ufl.edu/research/products/index.html.  Note these may have been funded, but the research doesn't have to be funded.  Also, the research may be linked to an Agreement (for example, a Grant), but does not need to be." .
