<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/scientific-research#Phase4ClinicalTrial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ERO_0000016> .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/scientific-research#Phase4ClinicalTrial> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "In Phase 4 trials, post marketing studies delineate additional information including the drug's or treatment's risks, benefits, and optimal use." .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/scientific-research#Phase4ClinicalTrial> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Phase 4 Clinical Trial" .
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/scientific-research#Phase4ClinicalTrial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Phase 4 Clinical Trial"@en .
